msgstr "你收到了團隊邀請。接受邀請後，各項操作權限仍需分別授權。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.PERMISSION_HINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.PERMISSION_HINT"
msgid "Permissions are separate. Going offline retains permissions and accepted tasks; leaving the team revokes permissions."
msgstr "各項權限互相獨立。暫時離線保留原授權和已下達的任務；主動離隊會撤銷該成員的授權。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.LAST_ADMINISTRATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.LAST_ADMINISTRATOR"
msgid "The last administrator must hand over administration before leaving."
msgstr "最後一位管理員需先交接，再離開團隊。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.PENDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.PENDING"
msgid "Request sent. Waiting for the host to confirm."
msgstr "請求已送出，等待星系主人確認。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ADMIN_ONLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ADMIN_ONLY"
msgid "Only team administrators can invite players or change member permissions."
msgstr "只有團隊管理員可以邀請玩家和修改成員權限。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.NATIVE_NOTICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.NATIVE_NOTICE"
msgid "Duplicant permissions can be configured. Direct commands are not available yet; authorized digs use normal local duplicant behavior."
msgstr "可預先設定複製人指揮權限；直接移動等操作尚未開放。授權挖掘由當地複製人按原生規則執行。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.HOST_NOTICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.HOST_NOTICE"
msgid "Teams currently manage only the host’s loaded planet. Guest planet hosting is not available yet."
msgstr "目前只支援星系主人本機已載入星球的團隊管理；客人星球託管尚未開放。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_HOST_NATIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_HOST_NATIVE"
msgid "A loaded and admitted host planet is required."
msgstr "需要星系主人本機已載入並已加入星系的星球。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_AUTHORITY_CHANGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_AUTHORITY_CHANGED"
msgid "The planet or save changed. The old team is inactive; create a new system."
msgstr "星球或存檔已更換，舊團隊已停用。請重新建立星系。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_BUDGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_BUDGET"
msgid "Too many team requests. Wait for pending requests to finish."
msgstr "團隊請求暫時過多，請等待既有請求完成。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_DENIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_DENIED"
msgid "The host rejected this change. Check your administrator role, invitation, and permissions."
msgstr "星系主人未接受這項修改。請檢查管理員身分、邀請或授權是否仍然有效。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_UNAVAILABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TEAM.ERROR_UNAVAILABLE"
msgid "The team is unavailable. Wait for the connection or host planet to recover."
msgstr "團隊暫時無法使用，請等待連線或星系主人的星球恢復。"

