msgstr "左鍵選格或拖選，點擊挖掘提交；右鍵拖動視野。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.LEGEND
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.LEGEND"
msgid "Slash: draft · Box: syncing · Cross: confirmed · Red: rejected"
msgstr "斜線：草稿 · 方框：同步中 · 交叉：已確認 · 紅色：未接受"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.PRIORITY
