msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.UNEXPLORED"
msgid "The selection includes unexplored cells. Select again."
msgstr "選區包含未探索格子，請重新選擇。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.SOLID_ONLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.SOLID_ONLY"
msgid "Select solid terrain for digging."
msgstr "挖掘選區必須全部是固體地形。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.STALE_SELECTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.STALE_SELECTION"
