msgstr "觀察狀態已變化，請等待地圖更新後重新選格。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.LOCAL_DRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.LOCAL_DRAFT"
msgid "Local draft kept but not sent. Check permission and connection."
msgstr "已保留本機草稿，尚未傳送；請檢查授權與連線。"

#. STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.NOT_AUTHORIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.ONIONLINE.TASKVIEW.NOT_AUTHORIZED"
